          "observation": {
            "status": "answered",
            "confidence": "high",
            "reason": null,
            "answer": "To write off a batch, a Pharmacy Manager must do so, and a reason is required (the default reason is \"Expired\"). A batch that is already empty cannot be written off. A write-off sets the batch's remaining quantity to zero, recalculates the medicine's stock quantity from its non-expired batches, and appends a `waste` movement to the stock ledger. [S1]",
